<title>BELGIUM: INDOSUEZ BELGIUM BECOMES 5TH BIBOR MARKET MAKER.</title>
<headline>INDOSUEZ BELGIUM BECOMES 5TH BIBOR MARKET MAKER.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian Indosuez Bank will become the fifth market maker in BIBOR futures on Belgian futures and options exchange Belfox on October 1, Belfox said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The others are Banque Bruxelles Lambert (BBL), Kredietbank, CCF and Chase Manhattan Bank.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
